OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 30 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,5,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod pursues Franz
OL,7,     GXaver Mozart as he returns to
OL,8,     GVienna, a period when his health
OL,9,     Gbegan to rapidly decline.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc with live music from Leon
OL,12,     GMcCawley and Tom Ollendorff and
OL,13,     Ghis band.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gclassical soundscape, bookended
OL,17,     Gwith music inspired by
OL,18,     GShakespeare and his wife.
