OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GRichard Balcombe conducts the BBC
OL,6,     GConcert Orchestra in classic film
OL,7,     Gscores from British cinema, from
OL,8,     GChichester Festival Theatre.
OL,9,     GPresented by Petroc Trelawny.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,11,     GRachel Cooke confesses to being
OL,12,     Gdisappointed on what she thought
OL,13,     Gwas going to be the trip of a
OL,14,     Glifetime, and wonders if that
OL,15,     Gsays more about her or about the
OL,16,     Gholiday.
